-- Migration 0013 — Real content for Bodhisattva International.
--
-- Replaces the placeholder design-stage content (seeded from the original
-- seven-page design) with the institution's real content, supplied by the
-- owner on 2026-11-19: the institutional booklet "A Glimpse of Bodhisattva
-- International" (Oct 2026), the About / What-is-Newa-Art documents, the
-- owner's museum & gallery exhibition lists, and the owner's press-clipping
-- archive (2011–2022), cross-checked against published sources.
--
-- Scope (data only; no schema change):
--   1. site_settings: real address (House No. 91, Diamond Marg, Kupondole)
--      and opening hours as printed on the institution's own posters
--      (Tue–Sun 12–6, closed Mondays), replacing the contradictory seed.
--   2. page_sections: real text/images for Home, Museum, Foundation and
--      About sections (published + draft revisions); the invented Museum
--      floor directory is hidden until the owner supplies the real layout.
--   3. exhibitions / collections / foundation_programs / news_articles:
--      the fictional seed records (by slug) are deleted and the real
--      records inserted. Any record an admin created is left untouched.
--      The five news categories are ensured first (no-op where they
--      already exist) so article category references resolve even on a
--      fresh database where db:seed has not run yet.
--      Gift Shop products and testimonials are NOT touched (no real data
--      supplied for them yet).
-- Images are served from the frontend's public/images/ (committed to the
-- repository with this migration), so no media upload is required.
-- Rollback: 0013_real_content_down.sql (same folder).

--> statement-breakpoint
